chen nervös Gestern habe ich mich gut vorbereitet und gut erholt Wenn ich mich setze beruhige ich mich","authoredText":"Heute stehe ich früh auf. Zuerst dusche ich mich und wäsche mir die Haare. Dann ziehe ich mich an und rasiere mich. Ich muss mich beeilen, weil der Verkehr schlimm ist. Ich treffe mich mit Anna vor der Kirche. Ich freue mich und fühle mich nur ein bisschen nervös. Gestern habe ich mich gut vorbereitet und gut erholt. Wenn ich mich setze, beruhige ich mich.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Mein Morgen vor der Hochzeit","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Enya, wie fühlst du dich vor der Party?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_012_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Ich freue mich sehr!","speaker":"Enya","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_012_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Ich ziehe mich gerade an.","speaker":"Enya","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_012_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Beeil dich, wir treffen uns in zehn Minuten!","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_012_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Keine Sorge, ich dusche mich schnell und bin gleich fertig.","speaker":"Enya","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_012_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Enya, wie fühlst du dich vor der Party?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_012_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Ich freue mich sehr! Ich ziehe mich gerade an.","speaker":"Enya","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_012_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Beeil dich, wir treffen uns in zehn Minuten!","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_012_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Keine Sorge, ich dusche mich schnell und bin gleich fertig.","speaker":"Enya","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_012_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Ich dusche mich, ziehe mich an und beeile mich zur Arbeit.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Dein Partner fragt: Wie beginnt dein Tag?","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Ich freue mich auf das Wochenende und interessiere mich für den Kurs.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-12-reflexive-verben","level":"A2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Deine Freundin fragt: Worauf freust du dich?","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Ich entschuldige mich. Der Bus k